    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Dixon Residential Estate Agents are delighted to present 23 Morrow House to the Dublin 13 property market.\r\n\r\nThis superb one-bedroom own-door apartment comes to the market offering bright, well-proportioned accommodation in the heart of Baldoyle. \r\n\r\nExtending to approximately 52 sq.m, the property has been thoughtfully laid out to maximise space and natural light throughout. The accommodation briefly comprises a welcoming open plan living room/kitchen, a spacious double bedroom, a bathroom, and a hallway with additional storage. \r\n\r\nSituated in Baldoyle in a quiet and residential location, easily accessible from the Coast Road, Grange Road and the M50. Clongriffin DART station is a five minute walk and there are numerous bus routes that service the area providing efficient links to the City Centre. There is a choice of shops, supermarkets and leisure amenities that include coastal walks, Father Collins Park and various sports clubs. There are also highly regarded primary and secondary schools in the area. The property is within close proximity to Portmarnock, Howth, Sutton and Malahide and also benefits from easy access to the Port Tunnel, M1 and Dublin Airport.\r\n\r\n***Disclaimer:***\r\n*All details are provided to the best of our knowledge. While we strive for accuracy, some information may have been provided by the vendor. We are not liable for any mistakes, errors, or inaccuracies in our online advertising, and we advise all interested parties to seek professional advice regarding any concerns.*"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Prime location\r\nExcellent transport links\r\nIdeal Starter Home"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: B"
      }
    ],
